            "copy": "<p>Like our delivery process, the timelines vary by item. Please refer to the processing time indicated on the product page or contact us to verify estimated dates.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Img_1_6901fe7d-c6c1-4b9b-a1c3-4d8a0c5a770f.png"
