      "settings": {
        "title": "In-Store Pickup",
        "copy": "<p>In-store pick-up is also available from our warehouse, with no additional charges. Just indicate your preference for pickup upon checkout.</p><p>Point of reference for our Northern California shipping and in-store pickup address is:</p><p><strong>Fitness Superstore</strong></p><p><em>537 Stone Rd STE F Benicia, CA 94510</em></p>"
