            "copy": "<p>This means the product is not assembled for viewing in our showroom. However, if the product is labeled “Available to Order” on our website, it is ready for purchase and can be delivered within the timeframe specified on the product page. We have two warehouses totaling 63,500 sq ft in Benicia, CA, which means around 80% of the products on our website that say \"Available to Order\" will be at one of our two warehouses.</p>",
