            "copy": "<p>Feel free to drop by during our operating hours:</p><p><strong>French Fitness</strong></p><ul><li>457 Industrial Way Benicia, CA 94510</li><li>Mon-Fri: 8:00 AM – 3:00 PM PST</li><li>925-430-6111</li></ul><p><strong>Fitness Superstore</strong></p><ul><li>537 Stone Rd STE F Benicia, CA 94510</li><li>Mon-Fri: 7:30 AM – 3:30 PM PST</li><li>925-215-2927</li></ul><p>Call us with any questions before your visit so we can assist you better.</p>",
